    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A social deduction card game of trust, betrayal, and tavern-born glory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather around the tavern table and lead your party on dangerous quests. But beware\u2014one of your companions might secretly sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, a leader selects a quest and forms a party. Players secretly play equipment cards\u2014Sword, Shield, Boots, or even a Curse. Success brings honor. Failure brings suspicion. And four failures mean defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone among you is working against the group. Can you uncover the traitor before it's too late? Or are you the one hiding behind a smile?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden-role card game with bluffing and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo &amp; AI modes for practicing or smaller groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive fantasy tavern setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 short matches, big tension</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A social deduction card game of trust, betrayal, and tavern-born glory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather around the tavern table and lead your party on dangerous quests. But beware\u2014one of your companions might secretly sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, a leader selects a quest and forms a party. Players secretly play equipment cards\u2014Sword, Shield, Boots, or even a Curse. Success brings honor. Failure brings suspicion. And four failures mean defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone among you is working against the group. Can you uncover the traitor before it's too late? Or are you the one hiding behind a smile?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden-role card game with bluffing and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo &amp; AI modes for practicing or smaller groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive fantasy tavern setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 short matches, big tension</p></li></ul>",
